OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fand cloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight, the best of any prolonged
OL,8,Fcloud breaks through Moray. A little
OL,9,Fdrizzle possible over the hills and
OL,10,Fwinds remaining light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FMainly dry. Cloudy to start
OL,13,Fbut occasional bright or sunny breaks
OL,14,Fdeveloping by day, the best of these
OL,15,Fthrough Moray. Cloud returns in
OL,16,Fevening. Winds will be moderate
OL,17,Feasterlies.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
